                <h2>Engineering reliable cloud delivery</h2>
            </div>
            <a asp-page="/Skills" class="section-link">Explore all skills <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>

        <div class="capability-grid">
            <article class="capability-card">
                <span class="capability-index">01 / CLOUD</span>
                <h3>Azure infrastructure</h3>
                <p>Cloud resources and environments designed for reliable, scalable delivery.</p>
                <div class="capability-tags"><span>Azure</span><span>Networking</span><span>Storage</span></div>
            </article>
            <article class="capability-card">
                <span class="capability-index">02 / AUTOMATION</span>
                <h3>Infrastructure as Code</h3>
                <p>Repeatable provisioning and configuration through infrastructure automation.</p>
                <div class="capability-tags"><span>Terraform</span><span>ARM</span><span>Modules</span></div>
            </article>
            <article class="capability-card">
                <span class="capability-index">03 / PLATFORM</span>
                <h3>Containers &amp; delivery</h3>
                <p>Container workflows and CI/CD pipelines that support consistent releases.</p>
                <div class="capability-tags"><span>Docker</span><span>AKS</span><span>CI/CD</span></div>
            </article>
            <article class="capability-card">
                <span class="capability-index">04 / INTELLIGENCE</span>
                <h3>AI &amp; automation</h3>
                <p>Prior experience applying AI and automation workflows to practical systems.</p>
                <div class="capability-tags"><span>Python</span><span>Computer Vision</span><span>AI</span></div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section">
