                    <h3>Software Engineer - DevOps Engineer</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Managed 5+ CI/CD pipelines across multiple environments.</li>
                        <li>Reduced deployment time by 40% and manual effort by 60%.</li>
                        <li>Used Docker and Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) for containerization and orchestration.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="project-tech-list">
                        <span class="badge">Azure</span><span class="badge">Terraform</span><span class="badge">CI/CD</span>
                        <span class="badge">GitHub</span><span class="badge">Docker</span><span class="badge">AKS</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

