                        <li>Built face recognition systems using Deep Face and ResNetV2 models.</li>
                        <li>Implemented AI models in Python with OpenCV for face encoding and comparison.</li>
                        <li>Designed and maintained project databases using SQL.</li>
                        <li>Leveraged Azure clusters to optimise model performance and data processing.</li>
                        <li>Automated AI model updates and streamlined dataset collection workflows.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="project-tech-list"><span class="badge">Python</span><span class="badge">AI</span><span class="badge">OpenCV</span></div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="home-career-item">
                <div class="career-date">2023</div>
                <div class="career-marker"></div>
                <div class="career-content">
